---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, placeholdersLeft } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.name}: who runs it and how its guides are made.`} noindex={placeholdersLeft}>
  <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>{SITE.name} explains how money products and rules work in India: mutual funds, insurance, credit, loans and tax. The aim is to help readers understand a topic and know what to check in the official document before they decide anything.</p>
    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>{SITE.owner}. You can reach us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>How guides are made</h2>
    <p>Each guide starts from a written brief of facts taken from primary sources such as AMFI, SEBI, IRDAI, RBI and the Income Tax Department. An AI writing tool drafts the text from that brief. Automated checks reject drafts that add numbers outside the brief, repeat themselves or pad the text, and a person reads each guide before it is published.</p>
    <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
    <p>We do not recommend schemes, stocks, insurers or products, and we do not predict or promise returns. Read the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> and the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for details.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
